  "build": "Debug, SQLite WAL, synchronous=FULL, batch window 0 microseconds; each profile ran for 2 seconds; process metrics sampled every 100 ms.",
  "method": "Three runs each: 500 independent sessions, 500 clients on one session with independent keys, and 1000 clients incrementing one shared counter. Each profile ran for 2 seconds; each client has a deterministic write-phase offset to distribute the 20% write mix instead of synchronizing writes. Atomic disjoint-key merges execute in the SQLite writer transaction; every run verifies durable counts, zero conflicts, and zero failures. Cache lock wait is timed only after try_lock detects contention.",
